00:57:48,960 --> 00:57:50,960
And you'll get a ton of different favorites from everybody.

730
00:57:51,200 --> 00:57:51,280
Yeah.

731
00:57:51,600 --> 00:58:04,640
Yeah, so I feel like Android has that less, and some of that might be a little biased because I don't have a bunch of Android friends, but one of my best friends is an Android user, and like what he recommended as like, oh, here's a great Android app.

